    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d763">

                <pb facs="1044" n="924" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg924"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/2772: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Warren</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-10-26T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 26,
                                1922—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>126. Your 172, October 17, 2 p.m. and Department’s 73, July 17, 3 p.m.<anchor
                        n="12" xml:id="d763-f1"/></p>
                <p>Advise Foreign Office Italian Government has just expressed its concurrence in
                    original proposal also that French Government concurs in proposal to wind up
                    international control October 31.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
